            adj[i][j] = '1'
            adj[j][i] = '1'

    # Now, we have C(m, 3) triangles. We need to subtract the excess
    # To do this, we remove edges from the complete graph to reduce the number of triangles
    # We can remove one edge at a time, and each removal reduces the number of triangles by (number of common neighbors of the two nodes)
    # For simplicity, we just remove edges until we reach exactly k triangles

    # Calculate current number of triangles
